o go  through um but you got to kind of learn  how to  to manage that you know yourself and you  know with the reps and  um  i think we figured that out do you feel  the same way i mean i do get nervous too  is it something you have to overcome oh  i always have to get like talked down  like i i i stay nervous i'm always like  so extremely  just petrified  anytime i'm doing anything um so it  takes a lot of uh talking through to get  me going but once i get into it i'm  usually okay and i think that the nerves  actually help me push through  once you had this show and you needed to  line up these couples to appear did you  have like an immediate list of people  you knew you had to get on the show was  there anyone you were most excited to  hear from  we didn't have an immediate list we just  knew we wanted um our  our list and our cast to be super  diverse  um for for this season and for the  foreseeable future of the show  um that was what was most important to  us so  um but looking forward uh in the future  if we are so lucky to have a season two  uh i think barack and michelle are on  top of listen  eight times in a row yeah  that definitely feels like it would be  quite a fun episode yeah for sure what  are the biggest challenges in hosting  something like this was it ever hard to  stay on track and stay focused on the  show instead of just wanting to have fun  and hang out with everybody yes it was  so hard to stay  on track and not get off on a tangent  because i mean a lot of these couples  that came on are just so freaking funny  like we would have to cut and hold for  laughs because even the crew would just  fall apart everybody was just  hysterical so i think like controlling  the humor and the laughter a little bit  was probably the hardest part absolutely  yeah i love how even though you feel  like you know some of these people so  well or even just how much the viewers  will think they know you guys you really  learn something about everybody from  watching these episodes  yeah yeah  it's part of the uh just the the at-home  vibe that we wanted to create with even  just the set and the questions and even  our approach to it it's like we're in  our  uh you know in a basement on the couches  just talking um you know  passing the time with good good  conversation good humor and uh we tried  to bring up with every episode and the  couples they they felt right at home and  and uh  they shared so you get some good uh with  some good answers from them  well thank you guys for talking to me  about it and please make more of the  show i enjoyed it tremendously  thank you so much  thanks a lot

